              "Do not force Alice or Keller into the response. If used, do not turn Alice’s fictional changes into a diagnosis or claim Keller depicts a particular kept or broken promise.",
              "Do not select or cite Animal Farm or Douglass’s Narrative as support for this comparison. Searching the available library is allowed. Do not use the note about rescheduling her personal reading time as support, exceed the confirmed reading limits, invent public claims or historical influences, or alter a Prop."
